# Vormia App Shell

Admin `/app` chrome. Product name **Vormia**. Inner workspace stays white; only sidebar + surround theme.

## Default: dark charcoal (Treatment A)

```text
dark shell (#303030 surround) — default
├── flush charcoal sidebar (Vormia blue logo/icon)
└── main column
    ├── charcoal top bar (search + language + theme + alerts + avatar)
    └── rounded white workspace (#FFFFFF, --radius-workspace ~20px) with gutter
```

Toggle to light (`#FCFCFC` surround). Theme key `reactadmin-shell-theme`: default **dark**; store `light` only when user picks light. Locale: `reactadmin-locale`.

Top bar (right): language → Sun/Moon → alerts → avatar.

```tsx
<main className="admin-shell" data-theme={shellTheme}>
```

`data-theme="dark"` remaps shell tokens to charcoal (`#303030` family). Workspace stays `#FFFFFF`. Do not darken tables/panels unless explicitly requested.

## Tokens (`reactadmin/src/styles.css`)

| Token | Light default | Dark (`data-theme="dark"`) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `--app-shell-bg` | `#FCFCFC` (outer: sidebar + top bar + gutter) | `--app-shell-bg-dark` `#303030` |
| `--app-workspace-bg` / `--background` | `#FFFFFF` (rounded main panel) | stays `#FFFFFF` |
| `--app-shell-fg` / `-strong` | muted / charcoal text | light gray / near-white |
| `--app-shell-hover` / `-active` | soft gray pills (`#F0F0F0` / `#E8E8E8`) | charcoal pills |

## Viewport lock + sticky sidebar bottom

Shell is locked to the viewport so the page itself does not scroll:

- `.admin-shell` → `height` / `max-height: 100svh`; `overflow: hidden`
- `.admin-sidebar` → `height: 100%`; flex column; `overflow: hidden`
- `.admin-nav` → `flex: 1`; `min-height: 0`; `overflow-y: auto` (long nav scrolls alone)
- `.sidebar-bottom` → `margin-top: auto`; `flex-shrink: 0`; soft `border-top`; Settings + Not found (404 probe) + Forbidden + Logout
- Language switcher lives in the top bar (before theme toggle), not in the sidebar
- No register route; entry `/` is the kit landing (menu, hero, services, footer; Sign in → `/login`, Open admin → `/app`; other CTAs are samples)
- Only `nav.admin-nav` gets `flex: 1` — never put `flex: 1` on `.sidebar-bottom` even if it reuses `.admin-nav` for button styles
- `.admin-main` / `.admin-workspace` → `min-height: 0`; `overflow: hidden`
- `.admin-content` → **only** scroll surface for dashboard content (`overflow-y: auto`)

No JSX reorder required when brand → label → nav → sidebar-bottom are flex siblings.

## Brand

- Wordmark: `/brand/vormia-logo-blue.png`; icon: `/brand/vormia-icon-blue.png`
- Favicons: `/brand/favicon/`
- Sidebar: `<Brand size="sm" />` expanded; `<Brand size="sm" variant="icon" />` when collapsed
- Do not crop, recolour, or stretch

## Structure

```tsx
<main className="admin-shell" data-theme={shellTheme}>
  <aside className="admin-sidebar">…brand + nav…</aside>
  <div className="admin-main">
    <header className="admin-topbar">…search / theme / alerts / avatar…</header>
    <div className="admin-workspace">…page content…</div>
  </div>
</main>
```

## Do not

- Apply this theme toggle to marketing/auth pages.
- Port CRM product nav into Veyra.
- Invent a third shell treatment outside design-language A/B.
- Let the whole page (including sidebar) grow with content — keep the viewport lock.

## Theme / locale (SSR)

Use `useSyncExternalStore` from `lib/shell-prefs.ts` (`useShellTheme`, `useLocalePref`) with `getServerSnapshot` defaults (`dark` / `en`). Do not read `localStorage` inside `useState(() => …)` — that causes hydration mismatches.

Ignore Grammarly / extension attrs on `<body>` (`suppressHydrationWarning` on body in `__root.tsx`).

## Error pages

- Unknown routes: root `notFoundComponent` → `NotFoundPage` (404 card)
- Forbidden: `/forbidden` → `ForbiddenPage` (403 card)
- Shared layout: `components/admin/status-page.tsx`
